 EVT_1006R_NAME;政府が民間企業を国有化;Government nationalises private sector;;;;;;;;;X\r
 EVT_1006R_DESC;今日の全国向けの演説で、我らが偉大な指導者は、国民を搾取して利益をむさぼる不誠実な企業をこれ以上見逃しておけないと語りました。政令第3256号bの補足から、16の旧公社が公共関係省に接収されることがわかっています。;In a public address today, our Great Leader has told the nation that he would no longer accept certain disloyal elements profiting at the expense of the People. In a side note to Government Decree NO:3256b, we have found that 16 formerly semi-privately run companies had been expropriated by the Ministry of Public Relations.;;;;;;;;;X\r
